---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Editorial from '../components/Editorial.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Our Experience" description="Read about Matrox’s water access assessment, utility customer experience research and community water and sanitation assignments in Zambia.">
  <Editorial title="Our experience" image="sewerage" alt="Excavation for sewerage infrastructure" side="left" offset="down" background="paper" intro>
    <p>Selected assignments that show how we document service challenges and gather evidence for practical decisions.</p>
  </Editorial>
  <section class="section"><div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading" data-reveal="rise"><span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span><h2>Selected Matrox assignments</h2></div>
    <div class="project-grid" data-stagger>
      <article class="project" data-reveal="rise">
        <p class="project-meta">Southern Water and Sewerage Company</p>
        <h3>Water access and availability assessment</h3>
        <p>Matrox assessed barriers women face when collecting water, seasonal availability against demand, and the effect of unreliable water on pupils and school sanitation. The findings informed priorities for improving access and reliability.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="project" data-reveal="rise">
        <p class="project-meta">Chambeshi Water Supply and Sanitation Company</p>
        <h3>Utility service delivery and customer experience</h3>
        <p>In Muchinga and Northern provinces, Matrox examined prepaid metering, payment channels, reported water quality concerns and network conditions to identify ways the utility could improve its service.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="project" data-reveal="rise">
        <p class="project-meta">Lusaka, 2018</p>
        <h3>Water and sanitation community research</h3>
        <p>Matrox contributed community research and engagement in Lusaka. The work documented sewerage and maintenance concerns in Garden Compound and unreliable water access in Mutendere.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div></section>
  <Editorial title="Gender and social inclusion" image="field-crew" alt="Borehole crew working on site" offset="up" background="paper">
    <p>As part of the Southern Water assignment, Matrox examined barriers to water collection and school sanitation and identified areas where utilities could improve women’s participation in technical and managerial roles.</p>
  </Editorial>
  <section class="section"><div class="container closing"><h2>Read the company profile</h2><a class="button" href="/downloads/matrox-company-profile.pdf" download>Download company profile (PDF)</a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
